# Allowlist: everything is ignored unless re-included below. Game-derived data (tiles, dungeon maps, gamedata,
# static.json, extracted files), third-party downloads (assets) and anything personal (work: saves, log, backups)
# must never reach the repository; tools/check_publish.py guards the rest before each commit.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/dd2.py
!/tools/
!/tests/
!/docs/
!/map/
!/.github/
!/packaging/
!/*.cmd
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/requirements.txt
!/requirements-build.txt
!/assets.lock.json

# generated or personal, even inside the re-included folders
/map/tiles/
/map/dungeons/
/map/data/
/map/build/
__pycache__/
/tests/local/expectations.json
